{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32207","headline":"西江贻钓叟骞生 · 温庭筠","name":"西江贻钓叟骞生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晴江如镜月如钩，泛灩苍茫送客愁。\n夜泪潜生竹枝曲，春潮遥上木兰舟。\n事随云去身难到，梦逐烟销水自流。\n昨日欢娱竟何在，一枝梅谢楚江头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}